ーンで握手会だったので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむめいとの皆さんがやってくださった飾り付けのまま私も握手をやらせていたまきました！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかげであみあみ族のなかでも混乱してる方が続出してしまい、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「えっ、今日あみ誕生日だったっけ！？」ってびっくりされる方が多かったです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"混乱させてしまった方、ごめんなさい❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみの誕生日はまだまだ先！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10月18日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てへぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"賑やかな1日でした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/02/13/1894633/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チームディズニー"}],"source":"archive"}